From 5deb70f28d90bbee6d3fd41f7fa4887b280212a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FreeholdOS Build <build@freeholdos.local>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] freeholdos: boot picture assets (ADR-152)

Replace the two textures of the built-in boot renderer: a full-screen lighthouse picture with a transparent window
for the loading bar, and the texture that scrolls behind it. Generated by branding/boot in freeholdos-platform.
The texture is 256 rows high: the renderer lines a texture up with the bottom edge of the mask.
---
 core/res/assets/images/android-logo-mask.png  | Bin 12104 -> 1222521 bytes
 core/res/assets/images/android-logo-shine.png | Bin 88700 -> 556 bytes
 2 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/res/assets/images/android-logo-mask.png b/core/res/assets/images/android-logo-mask.png
